# workspace

WorkspaceManager: roots, scan, persist. `importRootsAndScan(roots, containerId?)` adds new services and, when `containerId` is set, links every service whose path is under the imported folders (already scanned or new).
WorkspaceLoader: hydrate workspace.json + runtime.json into in-memory descriptors.
WorkspaceOrder: keep serviceOrder/containerOrder in sync with existing ids.
WorkspaceProjectScan: runs Java/PHP/JS/standalone scanners for one path.
WorkspaceMetadataRefresh: re-reads JS/PHP/Spring scripts, port, strategy and `portFile` (arquivo onde a porta foi declarada). `refreshScope` relê um container ou todos e descarta `customPort` quando o arquivo declara a porta.
ImportPathMatcher: path-under-root check and container assignment on import.
WorkspaceDefinitionSync: merge scanned defs with previous (port, java, scripts).
StateStore: JSON read/write for workspace.json / runtime.json.
